    "name": "Over Jump Rally",
    "steam_appid": 1959280,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DRIFT LIKE IT'S 1995</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your helmet on, fist-bump your co-pilot, and get ready to drive <i>flat out</i> for another lap in the legendary Forest stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself to improve your best times or just take a walk around the Yosemite Pioneer History Center, where the event takes place... you might find some familiar faces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CAUTION!</strong> Nostalgia overload!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WHAT'S THIS PROJECT ABOUT:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over Jump is an independent and unofficial tribute to Sega Rally Championship, the glorious arcade racing game from 1994. The idea is to recreate it using Unreal Engine 5: refreshing the graphics to today's standards while keeping the same arcade driving style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Art cover by <i>Mario \u00c1lvarez</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DRIFT LIKE IT'S 1995</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your helmet on, fist-bump your co-pilot, and get ready to drive <i>flat out</i> for another lap in the legendary Forest stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself to improve your best times or just take a walk around the Yosemite Pioneer History Center, where the event takes place... you might find some familiar faces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CAUTION!</strong> Nostalgia overload!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WHAT'S THIS PROJECT ABOUT:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over Jump is an independent and unofficial tribute to Sega Rally Championship, the glorious arcade racing game from 1994. The idea is to recreate it using Unreal Engine 5: refreshing the graphics to today's standards while keeping the same arcade driving style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Art cover by <i>Mario \u00c1lvarez</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "RALLY! Hot blazing sun! Relive arcade racing with Over Jump Rally \u2013 an unofficial remake of Sega Rally from the '90s. Unreal Engine 5-powered stunning graphics, nostalgic music, and intuitive controls bring classic racing to a new generation. Easy, right? Maybe!",
